  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "The spot in Varginha, Brazil, where strange beings are said to have appeared in 1996 is a vacant lot that still exists, fenced off but still visited, and there is a project to study it. A man named Italo Venturelli, a witness to the Varginha events, tells Michels this, passing on what he has heard. To him it means the place is still treated as the real site of the encounter, decades later."
